{"reviews":[{"id":"B00RPQHANC-0","r":5.0,"t":"Great product, I love it.","x":"I love this product.  It feels great, gives a hint of color and tastes good too.  The tube is a nice size and has a little mirror on one end. Keeps lips moist and soft. I will reorder.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-1","r":5.0,"t":"No more dry lips","x":"This keeps the dryest lips moisturized. I use it all year long. It has just a hint of color to it. Stays on for quite a while. Not really any flavor to it.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-2","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent","x":"I have one of these in every purse along with the bathroom and dressing table. This is the only gloss that doesn\u2019t dry my lips or leave residue.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-3","r":5.0,"t":"Love it!!!","x":"Love this stuff, can only find on amazon!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-4","r":5.0,"t":"Wonderful, sheer pink lip moisturizer","x":"Wonderful lip moisturizer. I have been using this for years and recently ordered it for my aunts. They loved it too. It just gives you a hint of sheer, shimmering to lips. Keep it moisturize without any stickiness. Love it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-5","r":5.0,"t":"My color","x":"I had been wearing this particular product BUT cold no longer get it at my local shop (pandemic, less items). Clicked on Amazon and I got the item I needed!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-6","r":4.0,"t":"All around helpful","x":"Have been using this for years, like mirror feature, color and softness of product. Colored tube makes it easy to locate in purse. Well done!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-7","r":5.0,"t":"Great product","x":"Cannot believe you cannot find this in stores anymore!  Great product. Fast shipping.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-8","r":5.0,"t":"Favorite stuff","x":"Smells good and feels good. Love the little mirror on the end.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-9","r":5.0,"t":"Blistex Lip Vibrance wins the day!","x":"I have used this product for years and was having a hard time finding it in the usual big box and drug store retailers. It was a relief to find it on Amazon. Blistex Lip Vibrance is tasteless with just enough sheen to allow for easy application and natural shine. The integrated mirror is an added benefit!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-10","r":5.0,"t":"Can't Find in Stores Anymore - Glad to find here","x":"I have always loved this product and was sad I could no longer find in Walmart or Target.  What I ordered and received is exactly the same.  It is not clear - it adds a little bit of color, which I like but my boys get annoyed when they take it out of my purse thinking it's normal chapstick :)","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-11","r":5.0,"t":"Can't Find in Stores Anymore - Glad to find here","x":"I have always loved this product and was sad I could no longer find in Walmart or Target.  What I ordered and received is exactly the same.  It is not clear - it adds a little bit of color, which I like but my boys get annoyed when they take it out of my purse thinking it's normal chapstick :)","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-12","r":5.0,"t":"Good Lip Color, Makes A Great Blush Too","x":"Perfect for adding realistic color to your face while avoiding a too-made-up look. (Not easy to do.I keep two, one in my purse and one in my stash of \u201ceveryday\u201d makeup at home. Just roll some on your cheeks and blend in, it works great as blush as well as lip color on its own or layered.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-13","r":5.0,"t":"Looks really lovely","x":"I love the way this feels on my lips!  I plan to buy this over and over again! The color works well enough to wear with or without lipstick. My iips stay moist all night after putting a coat on after I brush my teeth. I love this stuff!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-14","r":5.0,"t":"Happiness For My Lips! \ud83d\ude18","x":"I love the touch of color it adds while keeping my lips soft. It's so lightweight and doesn't feel like other balls or chapstick. And it smells as good as it tastes. Where I  live is rural. Really glad to be able to find it. \ud83e\udd17","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-15","r":4.0,"t":"This is my favorite lip gloss. It's both moisturizing and colorful!","x":"I like having a lip gloss that doubles as lipstick. No need to look in a mirror, just apply it like any lip gloss and it looks great.  The only problem is the plastic case often cracks before the product is all used up.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-16","r":5.0,"t":"It's my go to favorite","x":"This is my go to favorite. I love it and recommend it. There is a cute little mirror on the end. I like to apply over lipstick for a glossy look, or wear it by itself. It's refreshing to apply to lips when working out.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-17","r":5.0,"t":"Great!","x":"I love how these give your lips just a hint of color, and it makes them pop just a bit. Also, my lips feel amazing right after application. My package of 2 arrived on time in perfect condition. Thank you!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-18","r":4.0,"t":"Good purchase","x":"I use to buy this all the time. It's no longer in stores, so I have to buy it online. The product was exact what I asked for, an worked beautifully. The smell, flavor and texture were great.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-19","r":5.0,"t":"Great moisturizing lip balm with a touch of color","x":"I like that this gives just touch of color while moisturizing when I don\u2019t want to take the time to put on lipstick (lip tint) and lip gloss. I\u2019ve been using this for a few years.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-20","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect formula.","x":"I love how it moisturized my lips. I live in a very dry desert climate. The added sheer color is a nice benefit. It has become my all time favorite lip balm.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-21","r":4.0,"t":"Very creamy","x":"I like that it stays on and looks very nice.,I have a lot of allergies and lots of lipsticks bother my lips but the blistic works very well on my lips.,\u2764\ufe0f","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-22","r":5.0,"t":"Unbelievably moist!Very","x":"Very moist! Sheer with a hint of color ! I've used this product for many years  but haven't been able to find it until I finally found it on Amazon!!!!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-23","r":4.0,"t":"Nice lip balm, odd smell","x":"I have a lot of contact allergies, and this is one of the few lip balms I can use. I like the color, and it moisturizes well, but it has an odd smell.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B00RPQHANC-24","r":5.0,"t":"Blistex Lip Variance is fantastic","x":"I love this lip moisturizer, I love the tinted lip color and the little mirror at the bottom to use to put it on!  It\u2019s my favorite go to!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the moisturizing effect, saying it keeps lips soft and prevents dryness.","cites":[1,2,3,5,14,15]},{"text":"Many reviewers highlight the subtle hint of color and sheen it adds.","cites":[1,2,5,11,12,13,14,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers mention they can no longer find it in stores and are glad to buy it on Amazon.","cites":[4,6,8,10,11,12,15]},{"text":"The built-in mirror on the tube is a commonly appreciated feature.","cites":[1,7,9,10]},{"text":"Some reviewers note it has little to no flavor or taste.","cites":[2,10]}]},"qa":[]}